    "turn_idx": 102,
    "turn_text": "Well, I wouldn't lay it on so thick if you didn't have another chapter. But I'm just wondering, you know, you come from a very successful, achievement-oriented family. How that sat with you, and was there a period of depression after that? Or how did you?",
