        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes the listener would benefit from reflecting on their emotional experiences.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The listener understands 'another chapter' as referring to a new phase or life stage post-upbringing.",
