    "turn_idx": 205,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think that, of course, we do have laws that restrict, you know, how you can purchase guns. But it's also our Second Amendment right, right? It's in the Constitution. And while we have laws, you know, protecting our breach rights known, the First Amendment, you can't, you know, fire in a",
