    "turn_idx": 275,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, you put it on the ballot. Yeah. Yeah, the other thing that concerns me and we've had terribly large number of cases. I mean, 13 in one swoop, but more since then of people on death row in this state who through DNA evidence turned out not to be guilty of the crime for which they were convicted. And that to me, you know, the the the irrevocability of the death sentence of a death sentence seems daunting and concerning, because we are human and we are fallible.",
